<title>HONG KONG: Wing On Int'l interim net down 68.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Wing On Int'l interim net down 68.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   83.3     vs 261.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    27.0     vs 21.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  2.3 loss vs 360.7 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    151.1    vs 475.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,450.5  vs 1,378.2</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wing On International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 14-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Wing On International operates department stores and engages in insurance, property rental, hotel management, securities and commodities broking, investment and financial services.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on the legal costs on litigation.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
